PW HSE NSCF on the frozen SCF source committed in this directory (binary
wavefunctions, eig_occ.txt, chg.cube). Same k mesh with more target
bands; an explicit zero exx_fock_alpha is accepted like an omitted Fock term.

The charge density is standard SCF output generated with out_chg 1 12.
To regenerate the source, use the same STRU/KPT and INPUT with calculation scf,
nbands 3, out_chg 1 12, and out_wfc_pw 2.
The cube-based band references differ from the former binary-restart references
by at most 1.12e-4 eV: out_chg writes rho, while the binary restart writes rho_save.
INPUT.info retains only the seven source SCF parameters checked by hybrid NSCF.
